# Caretaker's Talent, level 2: the token it creates is a copy of the target (CR 707.2) and enters the battlefield as a new
# object, so the target's "this creature enters with six -1/-1 counters on it" applies to it (CR 614.1c, 707.9). In turn 3
# Uldaros Theorix casts a copy of Moonshadow (Bot2's Lightning Bolt killed it in turn 2): a 7/7 with six -1/-1 counters,
# a 1/1 token. In turn 5 Level 2 copies that token: the copy is a 1/1 with its own six counters, not a 7/7.

